        "locator": "Press Release (17 July 2024)",
        "text": "The draft RTS set out time limits for reporting of the initial notification of 4 hours after classification and 24 hours after detection of the incident, 72 hours for reporting of the intermediate report and 1 month for the reporting of the final report."
